            "detailed_description": "NumberLine 2 is the continuation of the popular (no.) puzzle. <br>You must repeat the indicated image from the numbers. But it isn't so easy - you can create only blocks with a &quot;1&quot;. Fortunately, the numbers interact with each other. You can only create a block with a &quot;1&quot;, but when you create it, the numbers on all adjacent blocks are incremented by 1. <br><br>Pleasant soundtrack, beautiful design and low level of complexity will help you to relax, and high level of complexity - strain the gyrations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Pleasant soundtrack <br></li><li> Futuristic design <br></li><li> Simple but addictive gameplay <br></li><li> Achievements <br></li><li> Steam Trading Cards <br></li><li> Low price</li></ul>",
